('12', 'How I\'d learn to code if I had to start over', '\"To try everything Brilliant has to offer—free—for a full 30 days, visit https://brilliant.org/CatherineLi You will get 20% off Brilliant’s annual premium subscription if you subscribe using the link above. ----------- 🚀 Want to learn programming but feeling overwhelmed? This comprehensive video breaks down exactly how to approach learning to code; from mindset to project completion. Perfect for beginners and career-switchers looking to enter tech. 💡 Featured Book Recommendations: \"\"The Dip\"\" by Seth Godin: https://amzn.to/3PS06cs \"\"Ultralearning\"\" by Scott Young: https://amzn.to/4hxO83k \"\"Data Structures and Algorithms in Java\"\" by Robert Lafore: https://amzn.to/4hucrPR ⭐ Recommended Learning Resources: The Odin Project Codecademy ChatGPT for practice problems #SoftwareEngineer #TechIndustry #CareerAdvice #CodingLife #SoftwareEngineering #TechMisconceptions #TechStruggles Music by Bensound.com/free-music-for-videos Artist: Benjamin Tissot License code: ZIUDYKVR4KVWSQSW A', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3V5LaqHqh4c', '687', '2026-02-13'),
('55', 'RuFlow Makes Claude Code Look INSANE 🚀', 'Think Claude Code alone is powerful? 😳 Then you NEED to see RuFlow. Right now it\'s one of the most talked-about AI frameworks on GitHub — and honestly, it feels insane. 🚀 Here’s what makes it different: 🔥 Spins up 60+ AI agents in parallel 🔥 Different agents handle research, coding, testing & reviews 🔥 “Queen agents” manage worker agents automatically 🔥 Shared memory makes workflows smarter over time 🔥 Smart model routing helps reduce token usage The craziest part? 😭 It’s completely open source and free. This feels less like “using AI” and more like managing an entire AI software company in the background. 🤯 If you want a setup tutorial, comment “flow” 👇 #ai #claudecode #claudeai #github #opensource #coding #programming #developer #aiagents #automation #aitools #softwareengineering #technology #tech #webdevelopment #productivity #artificialintelligence #developers #codinglife #youtubeshorts', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sf2FQ_cxCv4', '46', '2025-09-30'),
('64', 'Java Polymorphism Explained | OOP Tutorial for Beginners #programming #techeducation #coding', 'Learn the fundamentals of polymorphism in Java programming with examples and real-world applications. This beginner-friendly tutorial explains method overloading, method overriding, compile-time polymorphism, and runtime polymorphism in Object-Oriented Programming (OOP). This lesson covers: ✔ What polymorphism is ✔ Method overloading ✔ Method overriding ✔ Compile-time polymorphism ✔ Runtime polymorphism ✔ Real-world OOP applications Polymorphism is one of the core principles of Object-Oriented Programming and helps developers create flexible and scalable software systems. Perfect for: 🎯 IT students 🎯 Beginner Java programmers 🎯 OOP learners 🎯 Computer Science students Master polymorphism and strengthen your object-oriented programming skills 🚀', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MnKaDqhVLZs', '60', '2026-02-09'),
