('36', 'Fun Songs for kids - 30 mins - Nursery Rhymes for Kids - Preschool Songs for kids', '\"Welcome to our YouTube channel! In this video, we have a fantastic collection of fun songs for kids that will surely bring a smile to their faces. Join us as we sing along to popular tunes like \"\"Rain Rain,\"\" \"\"Old MacDonald,\"\" \"\"Tidy Up,\"\" and \"\"Teddy Bear.\"\" Get ready to dance, sing, and have a great time with these catchy melodies that kids love. Each song is designed to entertain and engage young minds while promoting learning and creativity. Whether your little ones want to dance in the rain, pretend to be farmers, clean up their toys, or snuggle with their favorite teddy bear, this video has it all! Our lively and colorful animations will captivate children\'s attention and make the songs even more enjoyable. We believe in the power of music to inspire and educate, and that\'s why we\'ve curated this compilation of beloved children\'s songs that will have the whole family singing and dancing along. So, gather the kids, turn up the volume, and let the fun begin! Don\'t forget to like,', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=twVWYqrCL48', '0', '2026-03-16'),
('74', '24/7 Music Production Tutorials Live | MPC Beat Making & Workflow', '🎓 Join the full course + producer community: https://skool.com/futureproducersociety Learn how to make beats step-by-step using real MPC workflow — while understanding how the music business actually works. This 24/7 music production stream shows real beat creation, sampling, drum programming, and arrangement techniques used in real records. At the same time, you’ll hear real conversations about placements, royalties, publishing, and how producers actually make money. You’re watching the real workflow of a multi-platinum producer with over 20 years of experience, with credits including Big Pun, Max B, French Montana, Nas, Prodigy (Mobb Deep), The Game, Jadakiss, Lloyd Banks, Freddie Gibbs, Killer Mike, Waka Flocka Flame, Wiz Khalifa, and more. 🎓 Join the full course + producer community: https://skool.com/futureproducersociety Inside Skool you’ll get: • Full step-by-step production tutorials (not just clips) • Music business breakdowns (royalties, publishing, deals) ?', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6WMXtqJ6QU8', '0', '2025-06-13'),
('47', '24/7 SELF EMPROVING KI KRYPTO TRADING BOT', '🚀 How I Built a Self-Improving AI Daytrading Kraken Bot 🚀 In this video, I dive deep into creating an autonomous trading bot for Kraken that improves itself using AI. From Python code to real trades, see how it analyzes markets, makes decisions, and evolves without human input. Perfect for traders and coders interested in algorithmic trading! 🔥 What You\'ll Learn: • Setting up a Kraken API bot with risk controls • Integrating AI agents for strategy optimization • Backtesting on historical data for accuracy • Real-time execution and self-improvement loops • Handling fees, slippage, and market volatility 📈 Key Features: • Multi-pair EUR trading (BTC, ETH, ADA, etc.) • Mean-reversion + trend-following signals • Volatility-adjusted position sizing • Sharpe Ratio & Kelly Criterion optimization • 24/7 autonomous operation on Raspberry Pi ⚠️ Disclaimer: This is for educational purposes. Trading crypto involves risk. Not financial advice. 🔗 Links: • GitH', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uLfRy6JC59w', '0', '2025-12-08'),
('64', 'Let’s Get Certified: DP-800 | Session 3 | Vector Search, Embeddings, and Indexing', 'Welcome to Session 3 of our “Let’s Get Certified: DP-800 | Microsoft Certified SQL AI Developer Associate” community learning event. This session focuses on the AI capabilities that make DP-800 unique for SQL professionals, including vector search, embeddings, AI model integration, and indexing strategies in SQL Server 2025. Learn how modern AI-enabled database systems support semantic search, Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), and intelligent application development directly within the Microsoft SQL ecosystem. Register for the full event: https://luma.com/ipwsbjaw Session Topics Include: • Native vector data types in SQL Server 2025 • VECTOR_NORM, VECTOR_NORMALIZE, and VECTOR_DISTANCE functions • Cosine, Euclidean, and dot product similarity metrics • CREATE EXTERNAL MODEL for AI model registration • AI_GENERATE_EMBEDDINGS for generating embeddings from text • Embedding storage and retrieval workflows • DiskANN vector indexing architecture • Accuracy versus pe', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lk1Q_YGH6LQ', '0', '2025-11-03'),
