('12', '\"Python Roadmap for Beginners! 🐍 Learn Python Programming Step-by-Step\"\" #python #conding\"', '\"Python Roadmap for Beginners! 🐍 Learn Python Programming Step-by-Step\"\" @MissionAdda4 #codingtutorial #pythonroadmap #cumputersciencegineeringjos **Description:** Are you ready to master Python from scratch? This comprehensive roadmap will guide beginners through every step of learning Python programming. From basic syntax to advanced concepts like object-oriented programming and web development, this video covers it all. Whether you\'re aiming to build your first Python project, dive into data science with Pandas and NumPy, or explore web development using Django and Flask, this roadmap will provide you with a clear path forward. Join us on this journey to becoming a Python pro! Python roadmap Python for beginners learn Python step by step Python tutorial Python programming Python projects data science with Python Django tutorial Flask tutorial\"', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IfKlGhRc7Dc', '5', '2025-08-19'),
('20', 'C++ vs Python: Hello World Program | Coding Shorts #coding #javascript #python', '\"Want to know the difference between C++ and Python? In this short video, we compare the Hello World program in both languages side by side. 👉 In C++, you need to include headers, write a main function, and use cout for output. 👉 In Python, it’s just a simple print(\"\"Hello, World!\"\"). This video is part of our C++ vs Python Shorts Series, where we compare programming basics like: Input/Output in C++ vs Python Loops in C++ vs Python Functions in C++ vs Python Variables and Data Types in C++ vs Python 🚀 Perfect for beginners, programmers, and computer science students who want to quickly see the differences between C++ and Python programming. 💡 Don’t forget to like, share, and subscribe for more coding tutorials and comparisons! 📌 Hashtags: #cpp #python #coding #programming #shorts #helloworld #learncoding\"', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WoaMeKdZBA8', '10', '2026-03-21'),
