('8', 'The Stanford Emerging Technology Review 2025: Frontier Tech For A New Geopolitical Era', 'The Hoover Institution and the School of Engineering at Stanford University held a panel discussion on Tuesday, February 25, 2025, at 5:00 PM ET for the launch of the Stanford Emerging Technology Review 2025 report in Washington, DC. Emerging technologies, from AI to microchips to robotics, are transforming societies, economies, and geopolitics in profound ways. Experts from the Stanford Emerging Technology Review (SETR) discussed how the United States can seize opportunities, mitigate risks, and ensure that the American innovation ecosystem continues to thrive. Download the full report here: https://stanford.io/41DqihD __________ The opinions expressed on this channel are those of the authors and do not necessarily reflect the opinions of the Hoover Institution or Stanford University. © 2025 by the Board of Trustees of Leland Stanford Junior University. 🔔 Subscribe for more discussions: @HooverInstitution 👍 Like and share this video! 🌐 Follow us on social media: • Facebook', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HxLVuO15v2I', '3296', '2026-03-27'),
