('33', 'Best Mid-Range Android Tablets (2026) | Top Tabs On A Budget', 'Reviewing the best Android tablets in 2026 for a budget of roughly £200 to £600 UK. I\'ve tested a wide variety, from the top drawing devices and eReader style Kindle beaters to super-cheap Android tablet action for students and the family. Here\'s my favourites right now, and you\'ll find full videos on them all right here! For an upper mid-range price, my top options right now include the Honor MagicPad 4 and OnePlus Pad 3. While the OnePlus tablet sports an LCD screen, the Magic Pad upgrades to a gorgeous OLED panel - it\'s certainly one of the best value devices if you want top performance and visuals, plus respectable battery life. The Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro is another fantastic mid-range Android tablet for a slightly smaller budget. Or if you\'re really tight for cash, check out the Redmi Pad 2 Pro or OnePlus Pad Go 2. Again, both offer solid value for money, ideal for families and students. Alternatively, gamers should check out the beefy RedMagic Astra tablet. This is one of the best op', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wzG7Yvsb2xw', '2607', '2026-02-14'),
('71', 'REDMAGIC 11S Pro Review: Same same, but Different...', 'What does the newly refreshed REDMAGIC 11S Pro bring to the table, and is it worth the upgrade? 🤔 I test out 8 Games in this Review (FPS) and cover all the normal phone stuff too! Buy Now: https://fas.st/t/FdheRFNT 00:00 - Intro, Price & Box Contents 00:26 - Charging & Battery Specs 00:41 - Design, Build, Cooling & Display 03:32 - Software & Features 04:11 - Hardware, Benchmarks & Gaming Features 05:46 - Gaming FPS Test (Genshin, Wuthering Waves, Call of Duty, Delta Force, Bright Memory, Alien Isolation, Red Dead Redemption & Grid Legends) & Temperature Test 08:23 - Haptics & Speaker Test (Every Game!) 09:19 - Worth the upgrade? Stay tuned for more videos just like this! Be sure to like, comment, and subscribe. Until next time, this is TechNick :) Social Accounts: https://linktr.ee/tech_nick', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VX66teeo5tI', '617', '2025-07-06'),
