('65', 'Bloomberg Business News Live', 'Programming schedule (EST): 12:00 AM - 5:00 AM: Bloomberg Global Business News 5:00 AM - 6:00 AM Bloomberg Brief 6:00 AM - 9:00 AM: Bloomberg Surveillance 9:00 AM - 10:00 AM: Bloomberg Open Interest 10:00 AM - 12:00 PM: Bloomberg Intelligence 12:00 PM - 2:00 PM: Balance of Power 2:00 PM - 5:00 PM: Bloomberg Businessweek Live 5:00 PM - 6:00 PM: Balance of Power 6:00 PM - 12:00 AM: Bloomberg Originals Stream link: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iEpJwprxDdk #bloomberg @markets #business #stockmarket #stocks #investing #bonds #investment #money #news #new #politics #bloombergtv #politics == Bloomberg Global News brings you live coverage of the markets open and close, plus everything you need to know across business, finance, technology, politics and more daily. Subscribe and turn on notifications so you don\'t miss any videos from Bloomberg: https://tinyurl.com/ysu5b8a9 Visit http://www.bloomberg.com for business news & analysis, up-to-the-minute market data, features, profiles and more. C', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iEpJwprxDdk', '0', '2025-12-19'),
('62', 'LOST ANCIENT TECH: Archaeologists Discover a Prehistoric Artifact in the Sahara', 'Buried beneath the shifting sands of the Sahara Desert, archaeologists uncovered a mysterious object during an excavation in a remote region, where unusual readings first drew their attention. What they found was not just an isolated relic, but a carefully arranged structure—almost aligned in sequence—made from an unknown material unlike anything ever documented in the archaeological record, especially in an area more commonly associated with known or lost Egyptian artifacts. The design and properties of the object raise more questions than answers. Intricate patterns and internal components suggest it may have served a practical function rather than being purely decorative or symbolic. Some experts believe it could be evidence of a long-lost technological system, pointing to a level of knowledge far beyond what we once attributed to ancient civilizations. Could this be proof of a culture that existed even before the Egyptians? Animation is created by Bright Side. -----------------', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FoDX8i0p-dg', '0', '2025-06-24'),
