('19', 'Xbot GO or Xbot Chameleon #techreview #tech #technology #review #ai #gimbal #sports #gopro #hello', '--------SOCIALS-------- ▶️Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/jedijainnit/ ▶️TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@jedijansenga?lang=en ▶️Twitter: https://twitter.com/TheOnlyJedija #tech #techreview #technology', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dYUAzwUSC7Q', '22', '2025-07-30'),
('11', 'Xiaomi Civi 5 Pro Camera Beast review #androidphone #technology #review', 'Introducing the Xiaomi Civi 5 Pro, soon to be unveiled as the Xiaomi 15 Civi in India! This premium mid-range smartphone is a camera beast with incredible features that will elevate your mobile experience. Enjoy stunning visuals on the 6.55-inch 1.5K quad-curved OLED display with a 120Hz refresh rate and vibrant colors. Powered by the Snapdragon 8s Gen 4, it handles gaming like a pro! Capture breathtaking photos with the Leica-tuned triple camera system and a remarkable 50MP front camera, perfect for selfies in any lighting. Packed with a 6,000mAh battery and sleek design, the Civi 5 Pro is your perfect companion. Like and share if you’re excited! #XiaomiCivi5Pro #SmartphoneReview #CameraBeast #TechNews #Xiaomi15Civi OUTLINE: 00:00:00 Xiaomi Civi 5 Pro: The Camera Beast!', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BP8XM1f15dI', '38', '2026-01-09'),
('5', 'Tesla Robot: Optimus Part1🦾✨#tech #review #technology #elonmusk #tesla #ai #robot #future #optimus', 'A quick look into Elon Musk\'s vision of the future. In this short video, we talk about the newest innovation from Tesla, the Tesla Robot, AKA Optimus. 💫 📢Make sure to check out part 2 of this technology review series.📢', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N9pcjlkdW6c', '47', '2025-09-14'),
('46', '#iphone #mobile #device #apple #smartphone #business #gadget #tech #technology #review', '#iphone #mobile #device #apple #smartphone #business #gadget #tech #technology #review', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yWZw-9fZ75M', '20', '2026-04-05'),
('50', 'The Future of Cars is Hilarious!#car #technology #review #future #shorts #gaming #gadgets #carlover', 'The Future of Cars is Hilarious!#car #technology #review #future #shorts #gaming #gadgets #carlover', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hqUurMasuRM', '51', '2026-04-18'),
('16', 'Dreame L10 Prime Robot Vacuum Cleaner Honest Review!💯#shorts #technology #robotvaccuum', '\"Yeh hai Dreame L10 Prime Robot Vacuum Cleaner – aur sach batane ke liye mai le aaya hoon full honest review. 29 April ko maine khud kharida hai apne paise se, koi sponsor video nahi hai.\"\" ✅ Positive Points (0:09–0:50)\"\"Chalo pehle positive points dekh lete hain: 1️⃣ Basic cleaning kaafi acchi karta hai, thanks to 2 rotating mops – kaafi ache se floor wipe hota hai.2️⃣ Carpet pe jaate hi 7mm mop lift ho jaata hai – matlab carpet gila nahi hota. That’s actually smart.3️⃣ Suction power 4000Pa hai – dust, hair sab nikal jaata hai. Sach bataun to jhaadu isse behtar lagta hai mujhe maid se bhi.4️⃣ Isme LDS sensor aur 3D mapping hai – toh bina repeat kare poora ghar scan karke clean karta hai.5️⃣ Cleaning ke baad mop khud wash aur dry hota hai – koi smell ya fungus ka chance nahi.6️⃣ Phone app simple hai – pehle map bana lo, fir daily schedule set karo. Ek baar set kar diya toh bas chill.” 7. Zoon cleaning best hai jitna jaga aapko chahiye or vo', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OlNggWNVsJ4', '168', '2025-10-21'),
('10', '#smartphone #technology #review #apple #iphone11 #tech #technews #iphonexsmaxvsiphone11 #funny', '#smartphone #technology #review #apple #iphone11 #tech #technews #iphonexsmaxvsiphone11 #funny', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M6A7lVOY6WA', '10', '2025-10-02'),
('9', 'Camera Skills. Is it called Autofocus or Blurry Background? #shorts #technology #review', 'Who does\'nt love a blurry background?', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9AW0aQY5Q1A', '20', '2025-12-28'),
('30', 'I’m back #technology #review', 'I’m back #technology #review', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rq9cpJ9M7qU', '49', '2025-09-26'),
('51', 'Scalers School of Technology review under 30 sec by Yash Garg @YashGargOfficial', 'Scalers School of Technology review under 30 sec by Yash Garg @YashGargOfficial', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pd7acox3G4I', '20', '2025-11-11'),
('32', 'The Best Sim Rig For Small Spaces', 'The GT Omega DD-X is a wheel stand that claims to be very heavy duty. That claim is verified by me, I was pretty pleased overall by how sturdy it was with my top-tier VRS setup during review. For the full review, check my Youtube channel, link in bio. You can also get 5% Off GT Omega with code DANNYLEE #simracing #racinggames #simracingsetup #gtomega #review', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JB9ZeucryL8', '112', '2025-12-10'),
('41', '#smartphone #tech #technology #review #device #android #ytshorts', '#smartphone #tech #technology #review #device #android #ytshorts', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gm8SLLHJzWE', '13', '2026-02-08'),
('55', 'Apple Vision Pro Review: Tomorrow\'s Ideas... Today\'s Tech!', 'Apple Vision Pro is a glimpse into the future... with today\'s technology Actually using Vision Pro: https://youtu.be/dtp6b76pMak?si=n14X6... MKBHD Merch: http://shop.MKBHD.com Tech I\'m using right now: https://www.amazon.com/shop/MKBHD Intro Track: http://youtube.com/20syl Playlist of MKBHD Intro music: https://goo.gl/B3AWV5 0:00 Intro 2:48 Immersiveness 6:35 Looking through glass 9:10 The Ecosystem 13:17 The Apps 16:06 The Comfort Issue 19:55 Eyes on the outside 21:40 So should you buy It? ~ http://twitter.com/MKBHD http://instagram.com/MKBHD http://facebook.com/MKBHD', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=86Gy035z_KA', '1488', '2026-02-28');
